<title>USA: Cincinnati, Ohio, $47 mln GOs won by PaineWebber.</title>
<headline>Cincinnati, Ohio, $47 mln GOs won by PaineWebber.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said it won $47 million of Cincinnati, Ohio, various purpose general obligation bonds with a net interest cost (NIC) of 4.689 percent.</p>
</text>
